# Capacitor native shell (Phase 0). node_modules/ is the scoped dependency
# exception in CLAUDE.md ground rule 1 — it produces the iOS wrapper and is
# reinstallable from package-lock.json, so it is not tracked.
node_modules/

# ios/ IS tracked. Capacitor writes its own ios/.gitignore, which excludes the
# build output AND ios/App/App/public — the copied web assets are regenerated
# by `npx cap sync` and must not be a second copy of docs/ in git. If those
# two trees are ever both tracked they will drift, and the bundle is the one
# nobody looks at.
